+### SplatLoc Localization Pipeline
+A feature-matching alternative that extracts 2D keypoints with descriptors via a pre-trained SuperPoint CNN, retrieves reference images from a reconstruction database, computes 3D descriptors from Gaussian primitives, matches them via cosine similarity, and estimates a 6-DoF pose using RANSAC+PnP [S2]. Choose this variant when explicit 2D-3D geometric correspondence is preferred over latent-code cross-correlation, particularly in AR reconstruction pipelines.
 
